      "content": "English: Zion | French: Sion | Latin: Sion | Origin: &#1510;&#1460;&#1497;&#1468;&#64331;&#1503; | Vietnamese: Xi-on -- núi, 2 V 19,31 ; Is 37,32",
      "kind": "MARK_KIND_FOOTNOTE",
